{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mq75a800","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/cloude","title":"[ingest] feat(mcp): ORCH_WORKSPACE env to target a workspace independent of cwd","summary":"mcp-graph.js posted process.cwd() as the daemon workspace on startup, so any process loading the orchestrator MCP (e.g. a headless agent in a git worktree) hijacked the global workspace pointer — repointing the live graph and blinding the agent to the real workspace's learnings/context. Now honors ORCH_WORKSPACE when set (else cwd, unchanged). Dogfood-finding #1.","created_by":"ingest","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-10T19:01:05.747Z"}
